te-sand beaches, crystal-clear lagoons, and rich marine life. Perfect for snorkelling enthusiasts and sunseekers alike, this natural reserve offers a serene setting for adventure and relaxation. As the catamaran glides across the open sea, soak in the panoramic coastal views and keep watch for dolphins dancing through the waves or whales making their majestic seasonal migration. With tranquil beauty, turquoise waters, and a vibrant underwater world, this island escape promises a day of awe, wonder, and lasting memories.","image_url":"https://www.islandcovemu.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/Tour-Image-Sea-North-Coast-Catamaran-1920x674-1.jpg","duration_minutes":420,"price_cents":8300,"currency":"EUR","area":"North Coast","category_key":"sea","adult_price_cents":5000,"child_price_cents":3000,"baby_price_label":"FREE","included_items":["Snorkelling","BBQ buffet lunch","Soft drinks & alcoholic drinks"],"excluded_items":["Water activities","Private cruise"],"itinerary":["Grand Bay departure","Gabriel Island","Snorkelling and swimming"],"published":true},{"slug":"speedileauxcerf-details","name":"SPEEDBOAT TRIP TO ILE AUX CERFS","summary":"*Including BBQ Lunch, Drinks, Snorkeling & Waterfall Visit","description":"Get ready to embark on an exhilarating speedboat trip to Ile aux Cerfs Island, the sparkling gem of the East Coast of Mauritius! Located near Belle Mare and Trou d’Eau Douce, this tropical haven is famous for its powdery white beaches, turquoise waters, and lively coral reefs. Whether you're snorkeling in crystal-clear lagoons, soaking up the sun on serene shores, or enjoying optional water sports like parasailing, undersea walking, and tube rides—this adventure is the perfect mix of thrill and tranquility. Discover the ultimate island escape as your speedboat glides across azure waters toward the captivating Ile aux Cerfs. Known for its lush greenery and vibrant beach vibes, the island offers both relaxation and excitement in equal measure. With breathtaking views and unforgettable experiences, this journey promises a quintessential slice of Mauritian paradise.","image_url":"https://dynamic-media.tacdn.com/media/photo-o/2e/fd/f0/88/caption.jpg?w=800&h=600&s=1","duration_minutes":390,"price_cents":8300,"currency":"EUR","area":"East Coast","category_key":"sea","adult_price_cents":4900,"child_price_cents":2800,"baby_price_label":"FREE","included_items":["Snorkelling","BBQ buffet lunch","Soft drinks & alcoholic drinks","Grand River South East waterfall"],"excluded_items":["Water activities"],"itinerary":["East coast departure","Ile aux Cerfs","Snorkelling","Waterfall visit"],"published":true},{"slug":"swimwithdolphine","name":"SWIM WITH DOLPHINS IN MAURITIUS","summary":"An Unforgettable Encounter with Marine Majesty at Tamarin Bay (West Coast)","description":"Mauritius, a tropical paradise nestled in the Indian Ocean, is celebrated for its stunning natural beauty, crystal-clear waters, and thriving marine ecosystems. Among its many attractions, one of the most unforgettable experiences is the opportunity to swim with dolphins in their natural habitat. This magical encounter allows visitors to connect with these intelligent and playful creatures while surrounded by breathtaking coastal scenery. Unlike artificial encounters that restrict dolphins to confined spaces, this tour offers a truly authentic experience in the open sea, creating moments that are both awe-inspiring and deeply humbling. Swimming with dolphins in Mauritius is a popular activity that draws nature lovers and adventure seekers from across the globe. As you glide through the turquoise waters, you’ll witness untouched landscapes and vibrant marine life, all while sharing the ocean with these magnificent animals. The experience not only brings you face to face with the grace and intelligence of dolphins but also fosters a deeper appreciation for marine conservation. It’s more than just a swim—it’s a memory that lasts a lifetime.","image_url":"https://mauritiusexplored.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Dolphin-swim-vitamin-sea.jpg","duration_minutes":150,"price_cents":8300,"currency":"EUR","area":"West Coast","category_key":"sea","adult_price_cents":6600,"child_price_cents":3400,"baby_price_label":"FREE","included_items":["Boat trip and safety briefing","Life jackets","Water and soft drinks"],"excluded_items":["Personal items and unlisted extras"],"itinerary":["Tamarin Bay","Dolphin watching","Guided open-sea experience"],"published":true},{"slug":"thechamarel","name":"THE CHAMAREL ADVENTURE TOUR","summary":"Discover Chamarel Wonders: Grand Bassin, Seven-Coloured Earth, Waterfalls, Rum, and Scenic Views","description":"Experience the beauty and magic of Chamarel with our unforgettable Adventure Tour in Mauritius. Discover the spiritual tranquility of Grand Bassin Lake, be mesmerized by the vibrant hues of the Seven-Coloured Earth, and witness the powerful cascade of the Chamarel Waterfall. Delight in a visit to the Chamarel Rum Distillery, where tradition meets taste, and take in stunning panoramic views of Black River Gorges and the iconic Le Morne Mountain. This journey through nature and culture promises memories that will last a lifetime. Join us and explore the wonders of Chamarel like never before.","image_url":"https://taxiservicemauritius.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/12-1.jpg","duration_minutes":420,"price_cents":7000,"currency":"EUR","area":"South / Centre","category_key":"nature","adult_price_cents":nil,"child_price_cents":nil,"baby_price_label":"","included_items":["Private transport","Pick-up and drop-off","Bilingual driver-guide","Flexible schedule"],"excluded_items":["Entry tickets","Lunch","Personal purchases"],"itinerary":["Trou aux Cerfs Volcano Crater","Grand Bassin (Ganga Talao)","Alexandra Falls & Black River Gorges","Seven Coloured Earth of Chamarel","Chamarel Waterfall","Rhumerie de Chamarel","Le Morne viewpoint"],"published":true},{"slug":"casela","name":"VISIT CASELA NATURE PARK","summary":"Unleash your wild side in Mauritius’ most thrilling outdoor destination.","description":"Casela Nature Park: Where Wildlife Meets Adventure .Get ready for an unforgettable journey through Casela Nature Park, a spectacular wildlife and adventure park nestled in the scenic Rivière Noire District on the west coast of Mauritius. Spanning over 250 hectares of lush terrain, Casela offers a unique mix of close-up animal encounters, panoramic landscapes, and heart-pounding activities. Whether you're feeding giraffes, riding through safari trails, ziplining above the forest, or simply soaking in the natural beauty, Casela has something for everyone — from families and nature lovers to adrenaline junkies. More than just a park, Casela is a hub of eco-tourism, conservation, and education, making it a must-visit for any traveler seeking more than just beaches. Discover the wild side of Mauritius — and let Casela Nature Park take you on a truly remarkable adventure. More Details","image_url":"https://mauritiusdiscoverytours.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Young-couple-feeding-giraffe-at-Casela-scaled.jpg","duration_minutes":300,"price_cents":7000,"currency":"EUR","area":"Cascavelle","category_key":"nature","adult_price_cents":nil,"child_price_cents":nil,"baby_price_label":"","included_items":["Private transport to Casela"],"excluded_items":["Park entry tickets","Optional paid activities","Lunch and personal purchases"],"itinerary":["Wildlife safari","Walk with the Lions (subject to park rules and ticket)","Bird sanctuary","Adventure activities","Kids’ playground"],"published":true},{"slug":"northtour","name":"CULTURAL NORTH TOUR","summary":"From Sugar Museums to Seaside Icons, Experience the Best of the North","description":"Embark on an exclusive 6-hour Cultural North Tour of Mauritius, designed just for you and your family. Journey through the island’s vibrant heritage—from the historic L’Aventure du Sucre Sugar Museum to the elegant Chateau de Labourdonnais and the iconic Red Church of Cap