"description":"Embark on an unforgettable journey with our Tea & Wildlife Exploration Tour! Discover the secrets of tea-making at Bois Cheri Tea Factory & Museum and stroll through lush gardens at Domaine de St Aubin and Domaine des Aubineaux. Encounter fascinating wildlife at La Vanille Crocodile Nature Park and admire stunning views at Gris Gris Viewpoint and Senneville Cliffs. With private tours, flexible start times, online payment and free 24hr cancellation, it’s the perfect family adventure—available daily and lasting approximately 6 hours. Book now for an enriching experience in the South-East of Mauritius!","image_url":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/18876569/pexels-photo-18876569.jpeg","duration_minutes":360,"price_cents":8300,"currency":"EUR","area":"South / East","category_key":"nature","adult_price_cents":nil,"child_price_cents":nil,"baby_price_label":"","included_items":["Pick-up and drop-off","Private transport","Flexible schedule","First child seat free on request"],"excluded_items":["Entry tickets","Lunch","Personal purchases"],"itinerary":["Trou aux Cerfs Volcano Crater","Grand Bassin (Ganga Talao)","Bois Cheri Tea Factory & Museum","Domaine des Aubineaux","La Vanille Nature Park","Gris Gris Viewpoint"],"published":true},{"slug":"portlouiscitytours","name":"PORT LOUIS CITY TOUR","summary":"Uncover Port Louis' hidden treasures-where history, culture and spirit unite","description":"Experience the vibrant soul of Port Louis with our exclusive City Tour, a journey that weaves together culture, history, and stunning scenery. Begin your adventure at the peaceful Marie Reine de la Paix, then admire the vivid colors of a local temple before exploring the lively Caudan Waterfront. Step back in time as you visit Chinatown, the Historic Bazaar, and the renowned Blue Penny Museum. Be captivated by panoramic views from the iconic Citadel Fort, and wrap up your day with a visit to the incredible Odysseo Oceanarium. This private tour offers a perfect blend of discovery and wonder—an ideal way to truly connect with the heart of Mauritius’s capital.","image_url":"https://www.mauritiustourtravels.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Exploring-Port-Louis-A-Journey-Through-Mauritius-Vibrant-Capital.jpg","duration_minutes":420,"price_cents":8300,"currency":"EUR","area":"Port Louis / North","category_key":"culture","adult_price_cents":nil,"child_price_cents":nil,"baby_price_label":"","included_items":["Pick-up and drop-off","Private transport","Bilingual driver-guide","Flexible schedule","First child seat free on request"],"excluded_items":["Odysseo Oceanarium entry","Lunch","Personal purchases"],"itinerary":["Port Louis Caudan Waterfront","Chinatown / Bazaar / Blue Penny Museum","Citadel Fort","Odysseo Oceanarium","Marine Reine de la Paix viewpoint (optional)","Colourful Temple (optional)"],"published":true}]
TOURS.each do |attributes|
